  "details": "When launching VRChat in VR there is no way to interact with menus(or anything else for that matter) using a gamepad as there is no head tracked cursor. This is a massive problem as makes it impossible for those without motion controllers to play in VR despite having a VR headset. This issue has persisted for nearly two years and as I don't own any motion controllers I have been unable to play in VR for that entire time.",
